# The ground track on the Simulate screen's right column, on a window tall enough to show all of it, with a dispersion study.
#   cargo run -q -p bowshock -- drive --example crates/bowshock/scripts/simulate-ground.drive out/simulate-ground
viewport 1280x1100

click (625, 18)
click "Run"
screenshot GroundTrack-dark.png

# Windy is the flight that lands farthest out; fly it 100 times with wind, launch angle and thrust varied.
click "Windy"
click "Run"
click "Run dispersion"
move (1100, 800)
screenshot GroundTrack-dispersion.png

# Compare: every ticked flight's track, the dots at the crosshair's moment.
click "Run all"
click (17, 94)
click (17, 138)
click (17, 226)
move (500, 300)
move (510, 300)
screenshot GroundTrack-compare.png

click "Light"
screenshot GroundTrack-light.png
